  "title": "Freightos Joins IATA Digitalization Leadership Charter to Advance Modern Air Cargo Connectivity",
  "summary": "Barcelona – Freightos Limited (NASDAQ: CRGO), the leading vendor-neutral global freight pricing, booking and procurement platform, today announced it has joined the IATA Digitalization Leadership Charter to support broader adoption of interoperable digital connectivity standards across the global air cargo ecosystem. As digital adoption across global freight continues expanding, interoperability and real-time connectivity between carriers, […]",
